// Tiny story exercising every engine feature, used by the engine and UI tests.

title: start
---
<<declare $answer = "">>
<<declare $score = 0>>
<<scene hall>>
<<music calm>>
Welcome #heading
<<hint "Ask a friend">>
A clue.
<<hint "Ask again">>
Another clue.
Secret word\: #input:answer #kind:password
-> Try
    <<if normalize($answer) == "opensesame">>
        <<jump door>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump wrong>>
    <<endif>>
===

title: wrong
---
<<set $score = $score - 1>>
Nope. #outcome:fail
-> Retry
    <<jump start>>
===

title: door
---
<<set $score = $score + 1>>
<<sfx creak>>
The door opens.
-> Left
    <<jump finale>>
-> Right
    <<jump broken_input>>
-> Hidden <<if false>>
    <<jump finale>>
===

title: broken_input
---
Type anything\: #input:undeclared_variable
-> Go
    <<jump finale>>
===

title: finale
---
<<music stop>>
The end. #ending:win
===
